abstract: >-
  Fast auto-correlation (ACF) and cross-correlation (CCF) function
  estimation for irregularly- and regularly-sampled 1D signals,
  scaling as O(n log n) via the Non-Uniform FFT (FINUFFT) and
  classic FFT.
